 "hast": "\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Callout\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mb-6 border-emerald-600 bg-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-900&#x22;}]\"><p><strong>Starting a new project?</strong> Use <a href=\"/create?template=start&#x26;base=base&#x26;rtl=true\">shadcn/create</a> for a fully configured TanStack Start app with custom themes, Base UI or Radix, and icon libraries.</p></mdx-jsx>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Steps\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><h3 id=\"create-project\">Create Project</h3><p>Create a new project using the <code>--rtl</code> flag and the <code>start</code> template.</p><p><strong>You can skip this step if you have already created a project using <a href=\"/create?template=start&#x26;base=base&#x26;rtl=true\">shadcn/create</a>.</strong></p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest create --template start --rtl\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest create --template start --rtl\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest create --template start --rtl\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest create --template start --rtl\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest create --template start --rtl\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> create</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --template</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> start</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --rtl</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>This will create a <code>components.json</code> file with the <code>rtl: true</code> flag.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;$schema&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json&#x22;,\n  &#x22;style&#x22;: &#x22;base-nova&#x22;,\n  &#x22;rtl&#x22;: true\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"style\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"base-nova\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"rtl\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">true</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><h3 id=\"add-directionprovider\">Add DirectionProvider</h3><p>Add the <code>dir=\"rtl\"</code> and <code>lang=\"ar\"</code> attributes to the <code>html</code> tag. Update <code>lang=\"ar\"</code> to your target language.</p><p>Then wrap your app with the <code>DirectionProvider</code> component with the <code>direction=\"rtl\"</code> prop in your <code>__root.tsx</code>:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">src/routes/__root.tsx</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import { DirectionProvider } from &#x22;@/components/ui/direction&#x22;\n\nexport const Route = createRootRoute({\n  component: RootComponent,\n})\n\nfunction RootComponent() {\n  return (\n    <html lang=&#x22;ar&#x22; dir=&#x22;rtl&#x22;>\n      <head>\n        <Meta />\n      </head>\n      <body>\n        <DirectionProvider direction=&#x22;rtl&#x22;>{children}</DirectionProvider>\n        <Scripts />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { DirectionProvider } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@/components/ui/direction\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> const</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> Route</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> createRootRoute</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">({</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  component: RootComponent,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">})</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">function</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> RootComponent</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">() {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> (</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">html</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> lang</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"ar\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> dir</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"rtl\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">head</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Meta</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> /></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">head</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">body</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DirectionProvider</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> direction</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"rtl\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">children</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">}</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DirectionProvider</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Scripts</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> /></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">body</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">html</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  )</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><h3 id=\"add-font\">Add Font</h3><p>For the best RTL experience, we recommend using fonts that have proper support for your target language. <a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/noto\">Noto</a> is a great font family for this and it pairs well with Inter and Geist.</p><p>Install the font using <a href=\"https://fontsource.org/fonts/noto-sans-arabic\">Fontsource</a>:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npm install @fontsource-variable/noto-sans-arabic\" __npm__=\"npm install @fontsource-variable/noto-sans-arabic\" __yarn__=\"yarn add @fontsource-variable/noto-sans-arabic\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm add @fontsource-variable/noto-sans-arabic\" __bun__=\"bun add @fontsource-variable/noto-sans-arabic\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npm</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> @fontsource-variable/noto-sans-arabic</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>Import the font in your <code>styles.css</code>:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">src/styles.css</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"@import &#x22;tailwindcss&#x22;;\n@import &#x22;tw-animate-css&#x22;;\n@import &#x22;shadcn/tailwind.css&#x22;;\n@import &#x22;@fontsource-variable/noto-sans-arabic&#x22;;\n\n@theme inline {\n  --font-sans: &#x22;Noto Sans Arabic Variable&#x22;, sans-serif;\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">@import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"tailwindcss\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">@import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"tw-animate-css\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">@import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"shadcn/tailwind.css\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">@import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@fontsource-variable/noto-sans-arabic\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">@theme</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> inline {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  --font-sans: \"Noto Sans Arabic Variable\", </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">sans-serif</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>For other languages, eg. Hebrew, you can use <code>@fontsource-variable/noto-sans-hebrew</code>.</p><h3 id=\"add-components\">Add Components</h3><p>You are now ready to add components to your project. The CLI will take care of handling RTL support for you.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add item\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add item\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add item\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add item\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add item\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> item</span></span></code></pre></figure></mdx-jsx>"
}
